  "fb": "Got three quotes that are wildly different? They were probably quoting three different projects.\n\nWrite one page first: who uses it, what it connects to, what's out of scope, and your budget range and deadline.\n\nWe'll help you write it on a free 30-minute call: xenovasolutions.com/contact",
  "ig": "Got three quotes that are wildly different? They were probably quoting three different projects.\n\nA one-page spec fixes that:\n01 Who uses it, and the jobs they need done\n02 What it connects to (integrations move estimates the most)\n03 What is out of scope\n04 Budget range and deadline\n\nSave this for your next project. Or book a free 30-minute call and we'll help you write it. Link in bio.\n\n#softwaredevelopment #startups #smallbusiness #projectmanagement #webdevelopment",
  "li": "Founders often tell us they got three quotes for the same project: £8k, £25k and £60k.\n\nUsually those were three different projects, because the brief left room to guess.\n\nA one-page spec closes the gap:\n→ Who uses it, and the 3 to 5 jobs each user must get done\n→ What it connects to \\(integrations move estimates the most\\)\n→ What is explicitly out of scope\n→ A budget range and a deadline\n\nWe're happy to help write it on a free 30-minute call: https://xenovasolutions.com/contact\n\n{hashtag|\\#|SoftwareDevelopment} {hashtag|\\#|Startups} {hashtag|\\#|ProductManagement}",
